  "oral_argument": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Thomas",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "d242b06a673cdd9762d4df6a09b3cffa87a33825e92f9c08d53a693dab2e5fc4",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-d242b06a673c-0000-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 6,
              "start": 6
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Thomas, justice Thomas: \u201cThe two contractors have testified about the treatment of detainees before, right?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kavanaugh",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "d242b06a673cdd9762d4df6a09b3cffa87a33825e92f9c08d53a693dab2e5fc4",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-d242b06a673c-0001-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 29,
              "start": 29
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Kavanaugh, justice Kavanaugh: \u201cTo what extent is the privilege a constitutional privilege? And to what extent do you think the privilege is a common law privilege that could be altered by Congress?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "d242b06a673cdd9762d4df6a09b3cffa87a33825e92f9c08d53a693dab2e5fc4",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-d242b06a673c-0001-0006"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 32,
              "start": 32
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Sotomayor, justice Sotomayor: \u201cMr. Fletcher, should we be thinking about this as a Reynolds case or a \u2013 an Intel case?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Gorsuch",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "d242b06a673cdd9762d4df6a09b3cffa87a33825e92f9c08d53a693dab2e5fc4",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-d242b06a673c-0001-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 36,
              "start": 36
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Gorsuch, justice Gorsuch: \u201cMr. Fletcher, do we start on an agreed premise that the government bears the burden of proving the privilege up?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Thomas",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "d242b06a673cdd9762d4df6a09b3cffa87a33825e92f9c08d53a693dab2e5fc4",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-d242b06a673c-0002-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 44,
              "start": 44
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Thomas, justice Thomas: \u201cMr. Klein, you said that much of this has already been disclosed. If it has been, why do you need additional testimony?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Barrett",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "d242b06a673cdd9762d4df6a09b3cffa87a33825e92f9c08d53a693dab2e5fc4",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-d242b06a673c-0002-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 48,
              "start": 48
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Barrett, justice Barrett: \u201cSo you don\u2019t need them for that?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "d242b06a673cdd9762d4df6a09b3cffa87a33825e92f9c08d53a693dab2e5fc4",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-d242b06a673c-0002-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 57,
              "start": 57
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Sotomayor, justice Sotomayor: \u201cMr. Klein, am I \u2013 I think I understand, because you\u2019re held in Guantanamo, you\u2019re not permitted to sign affidavits or give any testimony, correct?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "d242b06a673cdd9762d4df6a09b3cffa87a33825e92f9c08d53a693dab2e5fc4",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-d242b06a673c-0002-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 64,
              "start": 64
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Alito, justice Alito: \u201cCan this whole thing be boiled down into much simpler terms? Is it correct that what you want in the \u2013 in the end is a more official link between what happened and Poland?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "d242b06a673cdd9762d4df6a09b3cffa87a33825e92f9c08d53a693dab2e5fc4",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-d242b06a673c-0003-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 65,
              "start": 65
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Alito: \u201cWell, you know \u2013 you say you know what happened, and what you want to add is where it happened, right? That\u2019s the link. That\u2019s what this all boils down to.\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kagan",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "d242b06a673cdd9762d4df6a09b3cffa87a33825e92f9c08d53a693dab2e5fc4",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-d242b06a673c-0003-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 69,
              "start": 69
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Kagan, justice Kagan: \u201cDoes \u2013 does \u2013 is that in the end what your argument depends on, that we should treat the contractors differently from an employee? If \u2013 if these people were current employees, would your entire argument go up in smoke?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Gorsuch",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "d242b06a673cdd9762d4df6a09b3cffa87a33825e92f9c08d53a693dab2e5fc4",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-d242b06a673c-0003-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 74,
              "start": 74
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Gorsuch, justice Gorsuch: \u201cWill the government make Petitioner available to testify as to his treatment during these dates?\u201d"
      }
    ],
    "heading": "Oral Argument \u2013 Questions",
