  "overview": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "b1cb893711d795c32b66fad93265411e704163d6bf44e5c190951cfb8f3bf05e",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-b1cb893711d7-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 19,
              "start": 19
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court held that the state\u2011secrets privilege bars discovery of whether a CIA detention facility exists in Poland, precluding the government\u2019s request for information from contractors Mitchell and Jessen."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kavanaugh",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "b1cb893711d795c32b66fad93265411e704163d6bf44e5c190951cfb8f3bf05e",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-b1cb893711d7-0003-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 39,
              "start": 39
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kavanaugh filed a brief concurrence stating that Abu\u202fZubaydah showed only a \u201cdubious showing of necessity\u201d for the discovery he seeks."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Gorsuch",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "b1cb893711d795c32b66fad93265411e704163d6bf44e5c190951cfb8f3bf05e",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-b1cb893711d7-0004-0002",
              "ev-b1cb893711d7-0004-0010"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 54,
              "start": 46
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Gorsuch authored a dissent arguing that the discovery could proceed without revealing the location of the alleged CIA site and citing 28\u202fU.S.C.\u202f\u00a7\u202f1782 as authority for foreign\u2011related discovery."
      }
    ],
    "heading": "Overview",
    "status": "complete",
    "summary": null,
    "summary_citations": []
  },
  "party_positions": [
    {
      "claims": [
        {
          "attribution": "United States",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "b1cb893711d795c32b66fad93265411e704163d6bf44e5c190951cfb8f3bf05e",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-b1cb893711d7-0002-0002"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 24,
                "start": 24
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to United States, the Government said it had provided a reasonable explanation why the proposed discovery could significantly harm national security."
        }
      ],
      "heading": "United States Government",
      "status": "complete",
      "summary": null,
      "summary_citations": []
    },
    {
      "claims": [
        {
          "attribution": "Brian H. Fletcher",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "d242b06a673cdd9762d4df6a09b3cffa87a33825e92f9c08d53a693dab2e5fc4",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-d242b06a673c-0000-0000"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 4,
                "start": 4
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Brian H. Fletcher, fletcher argued that the nation\u2019s covert intelligence partnerships depend on keeping relationships confidential."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Brian H. Fletcher",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "d242b06a673cdd9762d4df6a09b3cffa87a33825e92f9c08d53a693dab2e5fc4",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-d242b06a673c-0000-0002"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 4,
                "start": 4
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Brian H. Fletcher, he said respondents seek discovery that would breach that trust by confirming or denying the existence of an alleged CIA facility in Poland, and that the request is not to vindicate U.S. rights but to aid a foreign (Polish) investigation."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Fletcher",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "d242b06a673cdd9762d4df6a09b3cffa87a33825e92f9c08d53a693dab2e5fc4",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-d242b06a673c-0001-0000"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 24,
                "start": 24
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Fletcher, he maintained that the executive\u2019s national\u2011security judgment deserves deference, and if the court agrees that disclosure would harm national security, the evidence must not be disclosed."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Fletcher",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "d242b06a673cdd9762d4df6a09b3cffa87a33825e92f9c08d53a693dab2e5fc4",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-d242b06a673c-0003-0003"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 75,
                "start": 75
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Fletcher, he clarified that all communications by Abu\u202fZubaydah could proceed subject to security screening, eliminating classified information."
        }
      ],
      "heading": "Brian H. Fletcher (Respondent)",
      "status": "complete",
      "summary": null,
      "summary_citations": []
    },
    {
      "claims": [
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Klein",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "d242b06a673cdd9762d4df6a09b3cffa87a33825e92f9c08d53a693dab2e5fc4",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-d242b06a673c-0001-0004"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 42,
                "start": 42
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Klein, klein stated that the Polish prosecutor already possesses information about the alleged CIA site, so U.S. discovery is unnecessary."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. KLEIN",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "d242b06a673cdd9762d4df6a09b3cffa87a33825e92f9c08d53a693dab2e5fc4",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-d242b06a673c-0002-0001"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 46,
                "start": 46
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. KLEIN, he explained that under Polish law Zubaydah has the right to act as a complainant and submit evidence to the prosecutor, with a right of appeal if the prosecution is declined."
        }
      ],
      "heading": "Mr. Klein (Respondent)",
      "status": "complete",
      "summary": null,
      "summary_citations": []
    }
